  "description": "These tender, deeply flavorful chocolate cupcakes take just 15 minutes to prep before baking—no stand mixer needed.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 1 hr 5 min.\n\nOptional substitutions: dark chocolate chips → chopped bittersweet chocolate\n\nMake-ahead and storage: Unfrosted cupcakes can be tightly wrapped in plastic wrap and frozen for up to 3 months. When ready to frost, thaw overnight at room temperature.\nFrosted cupcakes can be kept at room temperature in an airtight container for up to 3 days.",
